---
layout: layouts/base.njk
pageTitle: "Home Health Agencies in Schuylkill County, PA"
description: "Directory of home health agencies, visiting nurses, and home care aides in Schuylkill County, Pennsylvania. Phone numbers, ratings, and directions."
---

<div class="container">
  {% set breadcrumbs = [{label: "Home Health"}] %}
  {% include "components/breadcrumbs.njk" %}

  <h1>Home Health Agencies in Schuylkill County</h1>
  <p class="page-intro">
    Home health agencies bring skilled nursing, therapy, and personal care directly to your loved one's home. Whether you need post-hospital recovery support or ongoing care, these agencies serve families throughout the Coal Region.
  </p>

  {% set items = businesses.byCategory["home-health"].items %}
  {% for group in items | by_city %}
    <div class="city-section">
      <h2>{{ group.city }}</h2>
      <div class="card-grid">
        {% for item in group.items %}
          {% include "components/listing-card.njk" %}
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  {% endfor %}
</div>

<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "ItemList",
  "name": "Home Health Agencies in Schuylkill County, PA",
  "numberOfItems": {{ items.length }},
  "itemListElement": [
    {% for item in items %}
    {
      "@type": "ListItem",
      "position": {{ loop.index }},
      "url": "{{ site.url }}{{ item.url }}"
    }{% if not loop.last %},{% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
  ]
}
</script>
